    title: "A Google Business Profile Photo Checklist for Every Season",
    metaTitle: "GBP Photo Checklist for Every Season",
    excerpt: "A Google Business Profile that hasn't had a new photo in months looks abandoned. Here's a seasonal checklist to keep it current year-round.",
